==Event Information==
The Battle Cats has soared to a cool '''77 MILLION''' downloads worldwide, and it's time to celebrate!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between January 2nd (11:00am) and January 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Duel Stages Event!'''}}<br>
Put your honor on the line! Your strongest fighter versus one opponent in single combat!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between January 2nd (11:00am) and January 9th (10:59am)!'''}}

Visit the Special Stages section of the Legend Stages to challenge the Duel Stage.<br>
In any duel stage, you will only be able to deploy one Cat at a time against the single powerful enemy who appears! Think carefully before you choose who'll defend the honor of your Cat Army!<br>
A new fight will appear each day, so keep an eye out for the next challenger!<br>
Steel your resolve and get ready to face down your opponent!<br>
※ If Duel Stages do not appear, make sure that your Battle Cats app is updated to the most recent version available.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● The Tag Arena Opens!'''}}<br>
Pick your strongest partner and aim for glory!<br>
{{Color|#FF00FF|'''On between January 9th (11:00am) and January 16th (10:59am)!'''}}

Head to the Event Stages/Legend Stages and tap the Tag Arena map to take on this challenge event! Two of your toughest Cats versus two of the Doge Army's best!<br>
Can you earn victory with only a pair of Cats and your wits to guide you? A different battle each day to test your skill on the battlefield!<br>
※ If this event does not appear, please update your Battle Cats app to the most recent version.

{{Color|#FF6600|'''● Cat Food presents every day!'''}}<br>
Visit the Battle Cats app to collect a reward of {{Color|#FF00FF|'''20 Cat Food'''}} each day of the campaign!<br>
Don't miss a day for maximum Cat Food profit!

